        "title": "Spherically symmetric approaches in the theoretical study of low-dimensional magnets",
        "authors": "A. F. Barabanov, V. E. Valiulin, A. V. Mikheyenkov, P. S. Savchenkov",
        "url": "https://arxiv.org/abs/2605.16059v1",
