        "summary_cn": "本文通过伊森链量子淬火动力学，对服从玻恩规则的所有后测量态进行统计表征，建立了统计动力学量子相变框架。研究发现高矩平均可恢复动力学相变，临界时间附近出现能级交叉。同时提出基于单量子比特测量的量子计算协议，为实验研究统计DQPT提供了途径。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "\"We perform statistical characterization for all the possible post-measurement states distributed according to the Born's rule, by sampling a one-dimensional quantum Ising chain after a quantum quench dynamics. ... We map the distribution to a statistical model and characterize its effective 'energy' spectrum, and introduce the average dynamical free energy, establishing a framework for the statistical DQPTs. ... Our results provide a way for experimentally investigating statistical DQPTs in quantum devices, shedding light on the structured circuit sampling with insights from DQPT.\"",
