        "summary_cn": "本文提出在双极性磁性半导体（BMS）中实现可调控的交叉安德烈夫反射（CAR）。通过独立调节两个BMS电极的化学势，利用其导带和价带具有相反自旋极化的特性，可选择性增强或抑制CAR。该机制为操控非局域输运和关联电子动力学提供了新途径，有望应用于自旋电子学和超导器件。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "\"In bipolar magnetic semiconductors (BMSs), the conduction and valence bands possess opposite spin polarizations. We propose to achieve tunable control of CAR by independently adjusting the chemical potentials of the two regions. By engineering the alignment of spin-polarized bands in the two BMS leads, CAR can be selectively enhanced or suppressed.\"",
