        "summary_cn": "本文报道了一种具有N1O2-三齿配位位点的共价有机框架（AH-COF），用于稳定钴离子并调控其电子态，降低光催化CO2还原的能垒。利用该材料从废旧电池中回收钴，所得CoR-AH-COF催化剂实现33.6 mmol g⁻¹ h⁻¹的高CO产率，为废弃金属与CO2协同利用提供了新策略。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "“Photocatalytic CO2 reduction represents a promising route toward carbon neutrality and renewable fuel production. … Among the three Co-loaded COFs, Co-AH-COF exhibits the best photocatalytic CO2RR performance, affording a CO production rate of 34.2 mmol g⁻¹ h⁻¹. … These results demonstrate the feasibility of employing waste-battery-derived cobalt species as a precursor for efficient COF-based photocatalysts and provide a route for integrating CO2 conversion with waste-metal reuse.”",
