        "summary_cn": "本文提出一种基于金纳米颗粒（AuNPs）的单粒子原位光谱检测方法，通过统计发生局域表面等离子体共振（LSPR）红移的纳米颗粒比例，实现miR-451的无扩增定量检测。微流控芯片中固定AuNPs可实时追踪同一位点，消除空间采样误差，检测限达58 fM，并在加标血清中验证可行性。",
        "abstract_excerpt": "\"This work presents a novel in situ spectroscopic strategy for miRNA detection by statistically analyzing the percentage of gold nanoparticles exhibiting LSPR redshift. The amplification‐free approach enables precise monitoring of the same nanoparticles within a microfluidic channel, effectively eliminating spatial sampling errors. This method achieves sensitive miR‐451 quantification down to 58 fm, providing a new approach for accurate miRNA detection.\"",
