        "authors": "Simon Wili, Meng-Zi Huang, Tommaso Bonaccorsi, Michael Mühlematter, Mohsen Talebi, Yaakov Yudkin, Alex Gómez-Salvador, Filip Marijanovic, Eugene Demler, Tilman Esslinger",
